With Str and Con of 7 (as low as a wiz can start), the threshholds are
400 for burdened and 600 for stressed.  As long as they stash the
starting spellbooks (and any other not-useful-right-now items), an early
wiz would still have to be picking up a pick-axe/mattock and various
bits of dwarven armor, or to get very unlucky with poisonous attacks, to
be in the situation where a reasonable food supply (alright, 9 is a tad
more than "reasonable"...) made them stressed.

